<title>INDIA: India's MTNL up 2.2 percent on fund bids.</title>
<headline>India's MTNL up 2.2 percent on fund bids.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mahanagar Telephone Nigam Ltd (MTNL) rose 4.75 rupees or 2.2 percent to 218 on fund bids on the National Stock Exchange (NSE) in afternoon trade on Tuesday, brokers said.</p>
<p>They said more than 106,000 shares were traded on the NSE.  </p>
<p>Traders said foreign funds were bidders in select blue chips.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
